<p>By Pat Example</p>
<p>Good morning. Today we look at an invented debate about widgets.</p>
<table><tr><td style="line-height:14px"><span><span style="color:#666;font:normal 14px georgia,serif">A widget factory. </span><span style="margin:0;font:11px/11px georgia,serif;color:#888">Invented Photographer/The Pretend Times</span></span></td></tr></table>
<h1 class="css-1a0tlge">Which Widgets?</h1>
<p>Widget makers argue about who deserves credit for a record year.</p>
<h2>The optimists</h2>
<p>Optimists say demand will keep growing.</p>
<ul><li>One factory doubled output.</li><li>Another hired 300 workers.</li></ul>
<h3>TODAY&#8217;S NUMBER</h3>
<h2>5,000</h2>
<p>&#8212; That many widgets were sold in an hour, a pretend record.</p>
